# ---- Databricks Apps wheel exception ---------------------------------------
# The DevMirror engine wheel is built into ``app/dist/`` by
# ``scripts/build_app.sh`` and by the customer bundle's
# ``artifacts.devmirror_wheel`` step.  Databricks Asset Bundles respect
# .gitignore for sync, and the broad ``dist/`` / ``*.whl`` rules above
# would otherwise strip the wheel from the deployed app source --
# causing ``app/requirements.txt``'s install line to fail with "no such
# file".  Re-include just this one path.  The wheel is rebuilt on every
# deploy and should not be committed; if a developer accidentally
# stages it, that's caught at code review.
!app/dist/
!app/dist/*.whl
